  m_Name: Kill3Red
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogData
  sentences:
  - The forest grows more unstable with each passing moment.
  - The blue slimes were only the beginning.
  - "Now another kind has appeared\u2026 red slimes."
  - They burn with a strange heat, as if something within the forest has ignited
    them.
  - If these creatures continue to spread, the woods may suffer greatly.
  - Go, little wanderer. Defeat the red slimes and return to me.
